  "aiContextParagraph": "The 49th ASEAN Summit is currently underway at the Philippine International Convention Center in Pasay City, Manila. The regional gathering has drawn heads of state and government officials from various nations to engage in diplomatic discussions and policy sessions. Indonesian President Prabowo Subianto was welcomed by Philippine President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. and First Lady Louise Araneta-Marcos at the opening ceremony. The summit agenda encompasses critical regional priorities including the expansion of trade relations and the strengthening of maritime security protocols. Other notable attendees include leaders from Malaysia and Singapore, while representation from India is scheduled for upcoming sessions. The event serves as a platform for ASEAN members and international partners to coordinate strategies on geopolitical and economic challenges affecting Southeast Asia.",
